I can change the border radius shape with pixels, I can also choose which corner by using things like: EX: "border-top-left-radius: px 20".

I can use a body to edit the whole page or area, I can use a div to make a portion of an area that I would like to edit in.

padding creates space within an element, between its content and its border, while margin creates space outside an element, separating it from other elements. Imagine an element as a box: padding is the space inside the box, and margin is the space around the box. 
